OL,3,CTwo players for Iranian women's
OL,4,Cfootball team granted Australian
OL,5,Ccitizenship
OL,7,FTwo players for the Iranian women's
OL,8,Fnational football team have been
OL,9,Fgranted Australian citizenship
OL,10,Ffollowing their asylum requests last
OL,11,Fyear.
OL,13,FFatemeh Pasandideh and Atefeh
OL,14,FRamezanisadeh were sworn in as
OL,15,FAustralian citizens by Home Affairs
OL,16,FMinister Tony Burke in a ceremony in
OL,17,FBrisbane on Wednesday.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/5
