PN,30902
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1786033123
OL,3,CTwo players for Iranian women's
OL,4,Cfootball team granted Australian
OL,5,Ccitizenship
OL,7,FTeam members were labelled "traitors"
OL,8,Fby the Iranian regime in March this
OL,9,Fyear after they stayed silent during
OL,10,Fthe national anthem in their first
OL,11,Fmatch at the Women's Asian Cup.
OL,13,FAfter concerns were raised for their
OL,14,Fsafety, the Australian government
OL,15,Foffered the whole team humanitarian
OL,16,Fvisas.
OL,18,FSix players and a member of staff
OL,19,Finitially sought asylum in Australia,
OL,20,Fbut reversed their decision.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/5
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
