FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1786033123
OL,3,CTwo players for Iranian women's
OL,4,Cfootball team granted Australian
OL,5,Ccitizenship
OL,7,FRamezanisadeh and Pasandideh thanked
OL,8,Fthe Australian government for
OL,9,Fproviding a "safe haven in this
OL,10,Fbeautiful country", according to
OL,11,FChannel 7.
OL,13,FThey thanked Burke for granting
OL,14,Fhumanitarian protection and said they
OL,15,Fhave been overwhelmed by the
OL,16,Fgenerosity of Australia's Iranian
OL,17,Fcommunity.
OL,19,FThey said: "Your support has made us
OL,20,Ffeel welcome and less alone as we
OL,21,Fnavigate this transition.
OL,26,@{D@LOU
