CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1786033123
OL,3,CTwo players for Iranian women's
OL,4,Cfootball team granted Australian
OL,5,Ccitizenship
OL,7,F"At this stage, our primary focus is
OL,8,Fon our safety, our health and
OL,9,Fbeginning the process of rebuilding
OL,10,Four lives."
OL,12,FThe Iranian team arrived in Australia
OL,13,Fbefore the war began on February 28.
OL,15,FDuring the tournament, the women had
OL,16,Fmostly declined to comment on the
OL,17,Fsituation, although forward Sara Didar
OL,18,Fchoked back tears in a news conference
OL,19,Fas she shared their concerns for their
OL,20,Ffamilies and all Iranians.
OL,26,@oD@AOUrD@KO]
