OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1786033123
OL,3,CTwo players for Iranian women's
OL,4,Cfootball team granted Australian
OL,5,Ccitizenship
OL,7,FThe Iranian team drew international
OL,8,Fnews coverage after the players'
OL,9,Fsilence during the anthem, with some
OL,10,Fviewing it as an act of resistance and
OL,11,Fothers as a show of mourning.
OL,13,FThey later sang and saluted during the
OL,14,Fanthem before their remaining two
OL,15,Fmatches.
